294
00:17:59,580 --> 00:18:00,610
And the girl's brother

295
00:18:00,610 --> 00:18:02,310
even wants to talk to me.

296
00:18:06,110 --> 00:18:08,530
What's her brother called?

297
00:18:08,810 --> 00:18:10,610
That Yin Yucheng from last time.

298
00:18:13,770 --> 00:18:14,570
What's wrong?

299
00:18:15,110 --> 00:18:16,720
Can't I meet

300
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:17,980
a man alone?

301
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:20,480
It's fine.

302
00:18:21,730 --> 00:18:22,620
It's all Yun Ye's fault.

303
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:24,070
He's got me involved in this.

304
00:18:24,070 --> 00:18:25,010
And he's way too direct.

305
00:18:25,010 --> 00:18:26,980
Isn't he worried he'll scare her off?

306
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:27,770
No way,

307
00:18:28,270 --> 00:18:30,600
I think your little brother is quite cute.

308
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,440
Just like you.

309
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:46,030
Yun Li.

310
00:18:46,090 --> 00:18:46,790
Mr. Yin.

311
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:49,440
Thanks.

312
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:52,080
I asked you out
during working hours.

313
00:18:52,080 --> 00:18:53,570
Would this affect your work?

314
00:18:53,570 --> 00:18:54,480
It's okay.

315
00:18:56,210 --> 00:18:57,740
Do you have any thoughts
on what's going on

316
00:18:57,740 --> 00:18:59,140
between Yun Ye and Yunyi?

317
00:18:59,670 --> 00:19:00,890
Yunyi told me about it right after she

318
00:19:00,890 --> 00:19:02,070
received the postcard

319
00:19:02,070 --> 00:19:03,680
and asked for my opinion.

320
00:19:04,510 --> 00:19:05,940
Actually, I didn't really want

321
00:19:05,940 --> 00:19:07,330
to interfere with this matter.

322
00:19:07,330 --> 00:19:08,070
But my parents

323
00:19:08,070 --> 00:19:09,420
saw the postcard,

324
00:19:09,770 --> 00:19:12,170
so I had no choice
but to discuss it with you.

325
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:14,570
Actually,

326
00:19:14,570 --> 00:19:15,740
it's no big deal.

327
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:18,030
It's just that I'm a bit worried

328
00:19:18,030 --> 00:19:19,690
about them hanging out alone.

329
00:19:19,870 --> 00:19:21,220
So I will go with them.

330
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:23,500
But

331
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:26,420
it'll definitely be awkward

332
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:28,220
if I'm there when they meet.

333
00:19:28,220 --> 00:19:29,220
So I was wondering

334
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:31,240
if you could come along, too.

335
00:19:34,220 --> 00:19:35,010
Well...

336
00:19:36,140 --> 00:19:38,330
I'll go back and talk to Yun Ye about it.

337
00:19:39,850 --> 00:19:40,200
Okay.

338
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:46,740
You brought a gift for Yunyi last time,

339
00:19:46,770 --> 00:19:47,680
and she wanted to thank you.

340
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:48,180
So she specially

341
00:19:48,180 --> 00:19:49,440
prepared a small gift for you.

342
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:49,940
No, thanks.

343
00:19:49,940 --> 00:19:51,140
It's no big deal.

344
00:19:51,270 --> 00:19:52,480
Please take it back to Yunyi.

345
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:54,280
It's nothing expensive anyway.

346
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:55,530
So just accept it.

347
00:19:55,530 --> 00:19:56,920
Yunyi will be very happy,

348
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:58,520
and she hopes you'll like it.

349
00:19:59,380 --> 00:20:00,110
Okay,

350
00:20:00,110 --> 00:20:01,840
then please thank Yunyi for me.

351
00:20:02,180 --> 00:20:02,920
Well,

352
00:20:03,130 --> 00:20:04,420
after I discuss it with Yun Ye,

353
00:20:04,420 --> 00:20:06,070
I'll let you know our answer.

354
00:20:06,510 --> 00:20:07,570
If there's nothing else,

355
00:20:07,570 --> 00:20:08,720
I'll take my leave.

356
00:20:08,740 --> 00:20:09,890
Okay, let me give you a ride.

357
00:20:09,890 --> 00:20:10,690
Don't bother.

358
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:11,640
My office is just nearby.

359
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:12,720
I can walk back.

360
00:20:14,220 --> 00:20:15,010
Okay.

361
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:16,270
Goodbye.

362
00:20:16,810 --> 00:20:17,340
Goodbye.

363
00:21:16,460 --> 00:21:17,390
I'm in a meeting.

364
00:21:19,850 --> 00:21:20,350
Okay.

365
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:42,480
Is he so busy that he doesn't
even have time

366
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,810
to send an emoji or meme?

367
00:21:51,530 --> 00:21:53,980
Will I come across as too clingy?

368
00:21:55,610 --> 00:21:57,010
I knew he was busy on a business trip,

369
00:21:57,010 --> 00:21:58,740
but I still kept messaging him.

370
00:21:59,740 --> 00:22:01,980
What if he needs some personal space?

371
00:22:02,610 --> 00:22:04,070
Would he find me annoying?

372
00:22:16,080 --> 00:22:16,490
Hello?

373
00:22:16,890 --> 00:22:18,320
Hello, Li, what's up?

374
00:22:18,480 --> 00:22:19,810
Are Mom and Dad around?

375
00:22:19,810 --> 00:22:20,510
No,

376
00:22:20,510 --> 00:22:21,680
I'm in my room.

377
00:22:22,530 --> 00:22:23,140
Yun Ye,

378
00:22:23,140 --> 00:22:24,440
you're no longer a kid!

379
00:22:24,440 --> 00:22:26,510
Yet you still need me, your sister,
to clean up your mess!

380
00:22:26,510 --> 00:22:28,040
What are you talking about?

381
00:22:28,740 --> 00:22:29,940
Yunyi's brother

382
00:22:29,940 --> 00:22:30,810
saw the postcard

383
00:22:30,810 --> 00:22:31,880
you wrote to her,

384
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:33,180
saying you'd come to Nanwu.

385
00:22:33,180 --> 00:22:34,420
He plans to come with his sister

386
00:22:34,420 --> 00:22:35,480
to meet you.

387
00:22:35,480 --> 00:22:36,070
Wait,

388
00:22:36,090 --> 00:22:38,370
he said he'd come along?

389
00:22:38,400 --> 00:22:40,060
Do you think I made it up?

390
00:22:41,380 --> 00:22:42,180
Li,

391
00:22:42,570 --> 00:22:45,010
will you join us then?

392
00:22:46,460 --> 00:22:47,310
Why would I?

393
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:48,900
Li,

394
00:22:48,940 --> 00:22:49,900
could you just

395
00:22:49,920 --> 00:22:51,940
help me get her brother out of there?

396
00:22:52,000 --> 00:22:54,330
Are you using me as a wingman?

397
00:22:54,360 --> 00:22:55,160
I'm not going.

398
00:22:55,740 --> 00:22:56,940
I'm begging you, Li!

399
00:22:56,940 --> 00:22:58,140
Please just do me this favor.

400
00:22:58,140 --> 00:22:59,330
No way. I'm hanging up.

401
00:22:59,330 --> 00:23:00,210
Li! Li!

402
00:23:03,720 --> 00:23:04,700
This brat...

403
00:23:22,610 --> 00:23:23,420
Tangy,

404
00:23:23,740 --> 00:23:25,640
remember to put on more layers
when you go out.

405
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:27,720
You can catch a cold easily
in this weather.

406
00:23:27,720 --> 00:23:29,640
I think I've already caught it.

407
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:38,040
You're still caring about me
at this point.

408
00:23:39,740 --> 00:23:41,180
I'm so moved.

409
00:23:41,510 --> 00:23:42,440
What do you mean?

410
00:23:42,830 --> 00:23:44,960
Shouldn't you be more concerned about

411
00:23:44,980 --> 00:23:45,740
when Fu Shize

412
00:23:45,740 --> 00:23:47,010
is coming back?

413
00:23:48,240 --> 00:23:50,290
He's coming back next Monday.

414
00:23:55,310 --> 00:23:56,910
Even with my nose stuffed up,

415
00:23:56,940 --> 00:23:58,140
I can still

416
00:23:58,140 --> 00:24:00,670
smell something special
permeating the air.

417
00:24:01,830 --> 00:24:02,770
What is it?

418
00:24:05,780 --> 00:24:07,600
The smell of missing someone.

419
00:24:11,380 --> 00:24:12,220
I won't argue with you

420
00:24:12,220 --> 00:24:13,950
since you're having a cold now.

421
00:24:18,110 --> 00:24:18,980
Oh, right.

422
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:22,070
Fu Shize might come back

423
00:24:22,070 --> 00:24:23,530
in time for the first snow.

424
00:24:24,080 --> 00:24:24,840
This will be

425
00:24:24,870 --> 00:24:27,130
the first time you two see snow together.

426
00:24:27,180 --> 00:24:28,270
Have you heard that

427
00:24:28,420 --> 00:24:30,420
couples who see the first snow together

428
00:24:30,420 --> 00:24:31,880
will be together forever?

429
00:24:33,010 --> 00:24:35,380
Walking through the falling snow

430
00:24:36,810 --> 00:24:37,570
is like

431
00:24:37,570 --> 00:24:39,970
having grey hair and growing old together.

432
00:24:56,820 --> 00:24:57,630
Tangy,

433
00:24:57,880 --> 00:25:00,030
are you looking forward to it for me

434
00:25:00,030 --> 00:25:02,070
or for yourself?

435
00:25:02,770 --> 00:25:04,310
For you, of course!

436
00:25:06,420 --> 00:25:08,080
Next Monday is New Year's Eve.

437
00:25:08,080 --> 00:25:08,880
Compared to the first snow,

438
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:10,510
I'm looking forward
to New Year's Eve more.

439
00:25:10,510 --> 00:25:12,310
It's so lively on New Year's Eve.

440
00:25:12,830 --> 00:25:14,110
Who wants to see the snow

441
00:25:14,110 --> 00:25:15,240
with you lovebirds?

442
00:25:31,720 --> 00:25:33,440
I'm missing him so much.

443
00:25:34,810 --> 00:25:36,740
But he doesn't seem to miss me much.

444
00:25:40,310 --> 00:25:41,880
We are already dating.

445
00:25:43,010 --> 00:25:45,340
Why does it still
feel like a secret crush?

446
00:25:54,510 --> 00:25:56,440
Why the sudden video call?

447
00:25:57,510 --> 00:25:58,330
Ready for bed?

448
00:25:58,980 --> 00:25:59,770
Nope.

449
00:26:00,870 --> 00:26:02,870
Why are you just having dinner now?

450
00:26:04,920 --> 00:26:06,540
There was a technical issue earlier

451
00:26:06,540 --> 00:26:08,140
that the other party couldn't solve.

452
00:26:08,140 --> 00:26:09,330
I just finished talking with them.

453
00:26:09,330 --> 00:26:11,220
You guys still need
to pay attention to it.

454
00:26:11,220 --> 00:26:12,680
It's bad for your stomach.

455
00:26:13,010 --> 00:26:14,270
And drink less coffee, too.

456
00:26:14,270 --> 00:26:14,850
Mm.

457
00:26:15,940 --> 00:26:16,480
By the way,

458
00:26:16,480 --> 00:26:17,940
when are you coming back?

459
00:26:18,720 --> 00:26:19,510
Next Monday.

460
00:26:21,980 --> 00:26:23,580
It's gotten colder in Nanwu.

461
00:26:23,610 --> 00:26:25,420
It might snow on Monday.

462
00:26:26,030 --> 00:26:26,830
Is that so?

463
00:26:28,340 --> 00:26:29,610
Then remember to wrap up warm,

464
00:26:29,610 --> 00:26:30,680
in case you catch a cold.

465
00:26:30,680 --> 00:26:31,350
Mm.

466
00:26:32,540 --> 00:26:34,700
I haven't seen snow before.

467
00:26:35,770 --> 00:26:36,570
Really?

468
00:26:37,110 --> 00:26:37,790
Yeah.

469
00:26:37,980 --> 00:26:39,220
This might be my first time

470
00:26:39,220 --> 00:26:40,240
seeing snow.

471
00:26:45,880 --> 00:26:47,020
Then you should...

472
00:26:47,770 --> 00:26:48,570
What?

473
00:26:50,030 --> 00:26:52,090
Mind your step
on the slippery roads.

474
00:26:54,510 --> 00:26:55,310
I got it.

475
00:27:00,580 --> 00:27:03,000
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

476
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:07,610
[Schedule Reminder:
Fu Shize's flight departed]

477
00:27:26,030 --> 00:27:26,960
Wake up, wake up.

478
00:28:18,050 --> 00:28:19,440
What a pity.

479
00:28:20,090 --> 00:28:22,290
Why couldn't it have snowed a bit later?

480
00:28:22,510 --> 00:28:23,700
I wanted to see the snow

481
00:28:23,700 --> 00:28:24,680
with Fu Shize.

482
00:28:34,860 --> 00:28:37,310
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

483
00:28:37,340 --> 00:28:39,970
♪ Through ceaseless tides
that ebb and flow ♪

484
00:28:41,700 --> 00:28:44,200
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

485
00:28:43,500 --> 00:28:44,250
Yun Lili.

486
00:28:44,220 --> 00:28:47,610
♪ As we feel the changes of seasons ♪

487
00:28:48,190 --> 00:28:51,760
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

488
00:28:51,930 --> 00:28:54,790
♪ To meet the moon ♪

489
00:28:54,820 --> 00:28:57,500
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

490
00:28:57,520 --> 00:29:00,660
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

491
00:29:00,830 --> 00:29:04,990
♪ I just wanna stay with you ♪

492
00:29:05,170 --> 00:29:08,040
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

493
00:29:08,150 --> 00:29:11,890
♪ Love gives us all ♪

494
00:29:11,900 --> 00:29:13,220
You're back? Why?

495
00:29:11,910 --> 00:29:14,970
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

496
00:29:14,990 --> 00:29:15,810
♪ You know ♪

497
00:29:15,830 --> 00:29:19,070
♪ I'm in love with you ♪

498
00:29:19,090 --> 00:29:21,900
♪ No matter how many times I say
I love you ♪

499
00:29:21,010 --> 00:29:22,070
You wanted to see the first snow,

500
00:29:21,920 --> 00:29:25,500
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

501
00:29:22,570 --> 00:29:23,680
so I came back.

502
00:29:25,310 --> 00:29:27,160
I was just about to go to the airport
to pick you up.

503
00:29:26,400 --> 00:29:31,300
♪ I could say it ten thousand times
and never tire ♪

504
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:30,860
I took an earlier flight back.

505
00:29:31,090 --> 00:29:32,420
Perfect timing, right?

506
00:29:33,610 --> 00:29:34,220
Mm.

507
00:29:35,240 --> 00:29:36,110
Are you sleepy?

508
00:29:36,110 --> 00:29:38,240
Do you want to go home and get some rest?

509
00:29:43,010 --> 00:29:44,250
I was quite sleepy.

510
00:29:45,420 --> 00:29:46,880
But I'm fully charged now.

511
00:29:47,200 --> 00:29:48,000
Now?

512
00:29:49,460 --> 00:29:50,090
Mm.

513
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:55,220
I'm recharging now.

514
00:30:07,110 --> 00:30:08,000
Welcome home.

515
00:30:08,310 --> 00:30:09,770
You've worked hard today.

516
00:30:09,980 --> 00:30:11,310
Have a good rest at home.

517
00:30:11,330 --> 00:30:13,140
Hope you have a lovely day!

518
00:30:14,350 --> 00:30:15,080
Give it to me.

519
00:30:32,460 --> 00:30:34,120
You haven't seen snow before?

520
00:30:34,290 --> 00:30:34,860
Nope.

521
00:30:35,380 --> 00:30:36,790
It never snows in Xifu.

522
00:30:37,830 --> 00:30:39,090
This is my first time

523
00:30:39,090 --> 00:30:40,250
seeing snow,

524
00:30:41,310 --> 00:30:42,310
and it's with you.

525
00:30:46,440 --> 00:30:47,680
Then I'm very lucky.

526
00:30:53,200 --> 00:30:54,110
Fu Shize.

527
00:30:55,830 --> 00:30:57,350
Thank you for liking me.

528
00:31:09,290 --> 00:31:11,000
♪ It's you ♪

529
00:31:11,090 --> 00:31:13,300
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

530
00:31:13,330 --> 00:31:14,490
♪ Just you ♪

531
00:31:14,510 --> 00:31:17,170
♪ Are the instinct I can't quit ♪

532
00:31:17,270 --> 00:31:18,650
♪ It's always you ♪

533
00:31:18,680 --> 00:31:21,000
♪ Bringing faded colors back to life ♪

534
00:31:21,020 --> 00:31:24,290
♪ And keeping me company through
the endless night ♪

535
00:31:24,980 --> 00:31:26,350
♪ It's you ♪

536
00:31:26,370 --> 00:31:28,350
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

537
00:31:28,370 --> 00:31:29,600
♪ Just you ♪

538
00:31:29,620 --> 00:31:32,600
♪ All my heart defaults to ♪

539
00:31:32,620 --> 00:31:33,570
♪ It's always you ♪

540
00:31:33,590 --> 00:31:34,670
♪ Even the most ♪

541
00:31:34,690 --> 00:31:37,380
♪ Ordinary seasons feel warm again ♪

542
00:31:38,250 --> 00:31:41,130
♪ It's you ♪

543
00:31:39,210 --> 00:31:42,870
[Weather Forecast]

544
00:31:57,350 --> 00:31:57,900
Tang Lin!

545
00:31:58,810 --> 00:32:00,330
A friend of mine wants to see you.

546
00:32:00,330 --> 00:32:01,510
Who?

547
00:32:01,740 --> 00:32:03,340
You'll know when you see him.

548
00:32:03,590 --> 00:32:04,310
It's freezing cold.

549
00:32:04,310 --> 00:32:05,910
Can't you let your friend in?

550
00:32:06,550 --> 00:32:08,110
If this friend of mine comes inside,

551
00:32:08,110 --> 00:32:09,000
he might cry.

552
00:32:09,180 --> 00:32:11,040
What even is this gibberish?

553
00:32:11,220 --> 00:32:11,960
It's cold outside.

554
00:32:11,960 --> 00:32:13,090
I'll put this on you.

555
00:32:22,010 --> 00:32:22,660
Alright.

556
00:32:27,770 --> 00:32:28,300
Let's go.

557
00:32:49,090 --> 00:32:49,610
Look,

558
00:32:49,770 --> 00:32:50,640
as I told you,

559
00:32:50,640 --> 00:32:52,030
if my friend goes inside,

560
00:32:52,030 --> 00:32:52,720
he will cry.

561
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:56,180
So this is the friend
you were talking about?

562
00:32:56,270 --> 00:32:58,130
Made up a "friend" out of nowhere.

563
00:33:00,330 --> 00:33:01,260
What did you say?

564
00:33:08,500 --> 00:33:09,330
My friend said that

565
00:33:09,330 --> 00:33:10,900
he had something to tell you.

566
00:33:10,900 --> 00:33:11,380
Come on.

567
00:33:11,660 --> 00:33:12,520
Come over here.

568
00:33:23,140 --> 00:33:24,400
My friend said

569
00:33:24,400 --> 00:33:25,660
he liked your hairpin.

570
00:33:27,410 --> 00:33:28,410
Childish.

571
00:33:38,500 --> 00:33:40,160
Which side should we put it on?

572
00:33:49,290 --> 00:33:50,020
Looks great.

573
00:33:53,940 --> 00:33:54,730
Hold on.

574
00:33:56,700 --> 00:33:58,640
My friend has a question for you.

575
00:34:01,440 --> 00:34:03,010
He asked

576
00:34:03,310 --> 00:34:03,900
if you'd like

577
00:34:03,900 --> 00:34:05,700
to be Fu Zhengchu's girlfriend.

578
00:34:12,610 --> 00:34:13,400
I...

579
00:34:31,780 --> 00:34:32,580
Wait a minute.

580
00:34:35,710 --> 00:34:37,090
Should I close my eyes

581
00:34:38,409 --> 00:34:39,889
when kissing?

582
00:35:08,240 --> 00:35:09,360
Hello, Tangy.

583
00:35:10,500 --> 00:35:11,690
Sorry,

584
00:35:11,820 --> 00:35:14,220
I can't spend New Year's Eve
with you today.

585
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:16,050
I knew it!

586
00:35:16,690 --> 00:35:17,900
You've ditched your friend for a guy.

587
00:35:17,900 --> 00:35:18,550
You got a boyfriend

588
00:35:18,550 --> 00:35:20,190
and forgot all about your bestie.

589
00:35:20,190 --> 00:35:21,920
How are you going to spend today, then?

590
00:35:21,920 --> 00:35:24,250
Should I go back early
to keep you company?

591
00:35:24,260 --> 00:35:25,050
No, don't bother.

592
00:35:25,050 --> 00:35:25,690
Just enjoy

593
00:35:25,690 --> 00:35:26,820
your time together.

594
00:35:26,920 --> 00:35:28,120
Don't worry about me.

595
00:35:28,800 --> 00:35:30,400
Are you going to celebrate New Year's Eve

596
00:35:30,400 --> 00:35:31,420
with Fu Zhengchu?

597
00:35:32,630 --> 00:35:33,630
Of course not!

598
00:35:35,260 --> 00:35:36,210
Even if I spend it alone,

599
00:35:36,210 --> 00:35:37,300
I won't be with him.

600
00:35:37,710 --> 00:35:39,170
Besides, I still have Xia.

601
00:35:40,900 --> 00:35:41,860
I need to hang up.

602
00:35:41,860 --> 00:35:42,400
Bye-bye.

603
00:35:44,110 --> 00:35:44,860
Jiameng.

604
00:35:45,140 --> 00:35:46,320
I've finished

605
00:35:46,320 --> 00:35:47,110
the New Year posters

606
00:35:47,110 --> 00:35:47,650
and delivered them

607
00:35:47,650 --> 00:35:48,820
to all the departments.

608
00:35:48,820 --> 00:35:49,920
The ones for the experience center

609
00:35:49,920 --> 00:35:51,000
are on my office desk.

610
00:35:51,000 --> 00:35:51,760
Okay,

611
00:35:51,860 --> 00:35:52,820
I'll get someone to put them up

612
00:35:52,820 --> 00:35:54,620
at the experience center later.

613
00:35:55,780 --> 00:35:56,780
By the way, Yun Li,

614
00:35:57,000 --> 00:35:58,690
do you want to join us for dinner tonight?

615
00:35:58,690 --> 00:36:00,650
We'll go karaoke after dinner.

616
00:36:00,860 --> 00:36:01,800
Let's celebrate

617
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:03,860
New Year's Eve and have fun together.

618
00:36:04,710 --> 00:36:06,500
I'll pass.

619
00:36:07,090 --> 00:36:09,000
I have a date with my boyfriend.

620
00:36:10,500 --> 00:36:11,730
You have a boyfriend?

621
00:36:12,190 --> 00:36:12,980
Who is it?

622
00:36:13,190 --> 00:36:14,110
Is he handsome?

623
00:36:14,460 --> 00:36:15,660
Is he your classmate?

624
00:36:16,500 --> 00:36:17,500
Not my classmate.

625
00:36:18,320 --> 00:36:19,380
It's my colleague.

626
00:36:20,310 --> 00:36:23,310
Is it Engineer Fu?

627
00:36:25,800 --> 00:36:27,500
Yes, I'm dating him.

628
00:36:27,760 --> 00:36:29,050
Since when?

629
00:36:29,190 --> 00:36:31,510
Just recently.

630
00:36:49,710 --> 00:36:51,420
Why is it so quiet today?

631
00:36:53,400 --> 00:36:54,330
It was too noisy.

632
00:36:56,300 --> 00:36:56,910
It's so cold

633
00:36:56,910 --> 00:36:58,710
that my face is almost freezing.

634
00:37:08,820 --> 00:37:09,680
Still cold now?

635
00:37:12,590 --> 00:37:13,570
Nope.

636
00:37:20,400 --> 00:37:21,710
You're very lucky today.

637
00:37:21,710 --> 00:37:23,210
As a food blogger,

638
00:37:23,210 --> 00:37:24,820
I'm going to show off

639
00:37:24,900 --> 00:37:26,320
my skills for you.

640
00:37:26,920 --> 00:37:29,000
Since when did you become a food blogger?

641
00:37:29,000 --> 00:37:30,190
I'm an all-round blogger.

642
00:37:30,190 --> 00:37:31,110
This is my new title.

643
00:37:31,110 --> 00:37:32,730
I'll change my bio when I get back.

644
00:37:32,730 --> 00:37:33,320
Fine.

645
00:37:33,420 --> 00:37:34,820
Today, I'll be assisting

646
00:37:34,900 --> 00:37:36,230
the all-round blogger.

647
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:19,260
Are you cold?

648
00:39:46,410 --> 00:39:49,220
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

649
00:39:49,970 --> 00:39:52,620
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

650
00:39:53,420 --> 00:39:55,830
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

651
00:39:55,850 --> 00:39:59,050
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

652
00:39:59,960 --> 00:40:03,050
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

653
00:40:03,550 --> 00:40:05,710
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

654
00:40:05,970 --> 00:40:09,010
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

655
00:40:09,710 --> 00:40:13,010
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

656
00:40:14,580 --> 00:40:17,510
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

657
00:40:17,530 --> 00:40:19,690
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

658
00:40:21,570 --> 00:40:24,520
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

659
00:40:24,540 --> 00:40:26,830
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

660
00:40:27,910 --> 00:40:31,480
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

661
00:40:31,650 --> 00:40:34,510
♪ To meet the moon ♪

662
00:40:34,540 --> 00:40:37,470
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

663
00:40:37,490 --> 00:40:40,380
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

664
00:40:40,410 --> 00:40:44,570
♪ I just wanna stay with you ♪

665
00:40:45,140 --> 00:40:47,950
♪ No matter how many times I say
I love you ♪

666
00:40:47,980 --> 00:40:51,560
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

667
00:40:52,450 --> 00:40:57,350
♪ I could say it ten thousand times
and never tire ♪
